put the digits in order by reversing the first few each turn

4 5 3 6 1 7 9 2 8   how many to reverse?
> 7

9 7 1 6 3 5 4 2 8   how many to reverse?
> 9

8 2 4 5 3 6 1 7 9   how many to reverse?
> 8

7 1 6 3 5 4 2 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 7

2 4 5 3 6 1 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 5

6 3 5 4 2 1 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 6

1 2 4 5 3 6 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 4

5 4 2 1 3 6 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 5

3 1 2 4 5 6 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 3

2 1 3 4 5 6 7 8 9   how many to reverse?
> 2

1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8 9   in order after 10 reversals
